msgid "Raid scav_patrol text"
msgstr "A scav patrol is coming your way, fingers already on the triggers."

msgid "Raid scav_patrol luck"
msgstr "Say you're friendly"

msgid "Raid scav_patrol strength"
msgstr "Shoot first"

msgid "Raid lost_scav"
msgstr "Lost scav"

msgid "Raid lost_scav text"
msgstr "A young scav lost his crew and asks you to walk him to the exit."

msgid "Raid lost_scav agility"
msgstr "Walk him out"

msgid "Item pkm"
msgstr "Kaban's PKM"

msgid "Item ghillie"
msgstr "Partisan's ghillie suit"

msgid "Item amulet"
msgstr "Priest's amulet"

msgid "Raid trophy %{name} %{item}"
msgstr "%{name} beat the boss! Trophy: «%{item}»."

msgid "Raid path %{event}"
msgstr "The squad turned: %{event}."

msgid "Raid karma %{value}"
msgstr "Scav karma: %{value}"

msgid "Raid karma up"
msgstr "The scavs will remember this."

msgid "Raid karma down"
msgstr "The scavs won't forgive this."

msgid "Raid gnome_thief"
msgstr "Loot-thief gnome"

msgid "Raid gnome_thief text"
msgstr "A gnome in a red cap peeks out from behind the crates. His eyes gleam, his fingers already reaching for your backpacks."

msgid "Raid gnome_thief agility"
msgstr "Grab him by the cap"

msgid "Raid gnome_thief luck"
msgstr "Distract him with something shiny"

msgid "Raid gnome stole nothing"
msgstr "The gnome went through the backpacks, but they were empty. He left with nothing."

msgid "Raid gnome stole %{item}"
msgstr "The gnome snatched «%{item}» and vanished into the shadows!"

msgid "Raid komar"
msgstr "SBEU Tarkovsky Komar"

msgid "Raid komar text"
msgstr "A whine hangs over the swamp: SBEU Tarkovsky Komar, the mosquito, is out hunting. They say his wings bring unheard-of luck."

msgid "Raid komar agility"
msgstr "Swat it"

msgid "Raid komar luck"
msgstr "Back off, swatting"

msgid "Item komar_wings"
msgstr "Mosquito wings"

msgid "Raid axeman"
msgstr "Axeman"

msgid "Raid axeman text"
msgstr "A naked PMC with a hatchet charges at you, screaming. He has nothing to lose; you have everything."

msgid "Raid axeman strength"
msgstr "Meet him with fists"

msgid "Raid axeman agility"
msgstr "Run from the hatchet"

msgid "Raid cheater"
msgstr "Cheater"

msgid "Raid cheater text"
msgstr "A scav flies over the rooftops and shoots through three walls. Totally legit, of course."

msgid "Raid cheater luck"
msgstr "Send a report"

msgid "Raid cheater agility"
msgstr "Duck and weave"

msgid "Raid desync"
msgstr "Desync"

msgid "Raid desync text"
msgstr "You ducked behind the corner three seconds ago. The server will find out in five."

msgid "Raid desync luck"
msgstr "Trust the server"

msgid "Raid desync agility"
msgstr "Back off even further"

msgid "Raid extract_campers"
msgstr "Extract campers"

msgid "Raid extract_campers text"
msgstr "Something has been rustling in the bushes by the exit for forty minutes. It's definitely not a bush."

msgid "Raid extract_campers agility"
msgstr "Sprint for the exit"

msgid "Raid extract_campers luck"
msgstr "Toss a backpack as bait"

msgid "Raid prapor_quest"
msgstr "Prapor's task"

msgid "Raid prapor_quest text"
msgstr "Prapor on the radio: “Find me three teapots. Yes, teapots. Don't ask.”"

msgid "Raid prapor_quest luck"
msgstr "Look for teapots"

msgid "Raid sleeping_scav"
msgstr "Sleeping scav"

msgid "Raid sleeping_scav text"
msgstr "A scav sleeps on a crate, hugging a short AK and a bottle of Tarhun. His snoring fills the whole map."

msgid "Raid sleeping_scav agility"
msgstr "Go through his pockets"

msgid "Raid streets_fps"
msgstr "Streets of Tarkov"

msgid "Raid streets_fps text"
msgstr "Twelve frames per second on Streets. The squad moves in jerks, like a slideshow."

msgid "Raid streets_fps agility"
msgstr "Run through the lag"

msgid "Raid streets_fps luck"
msgstr "Update drivers on the go"

msgid "Raid bear_usec"
msgstr "BEAR vs USEC"

msgid "Raid bear_usec text"
msgstr "Two PMCs argue about whose faction is cooler. While they argue, nobody shoots."

msgid "Raid bear_usec luck"
msgstr "Agree with both"

msgid "Raid bear_usec agility"
msgstr "Slip past while they argue"

msgid "Raid grenade_scav"
msgstr "“Grenade!”"

msgid "Raid grenade_scav text"
msgstr "A scav yells “Grenade!” and throws something. Looks like a can of beef stew."

msgid "Raid grenade_scav agility"
msgstr "Catch the can"

msgid "Raid grenade_scav luck"
msgstr "Hit the dirt just in case"

msgid "Raid door_key"
msgstr "Locked door"

msgid "Raid door_key text"
msgstr "The key to this door costs as much as a Moscow apartment. You don't have it, of course."

msgid "Raid door_key strength"
msgstr "Kick it in"

msgid "Raid door_key luck"
msgstr "Try the handle — maybe it's open"

msgid "Raid jaeger_quest"
msgstr "Jaeger's task"

msgid "Raid jaeger_quest text"
msgstr "Jaeger wants three scavs killed with a PM — in a gas mask, at night, standing on one leg by the boat."

msgid "Raid jaeger_quest agility"
msgstr "Meet every condition"

msgid "Raid bitcoin_farm"
msgstr "Bitcoin farm"

msgid "Raid bitcoin_farm text"
msgstr "A farm of fifty graphics cards hums in the basement. One very nervous scav with a shotgun guards it."

msgid "Raid bitcoin_farm strength"
msgstr "Take the farm"

msgid "Raid bitcoin_farm luck"
msgstr "Scrape up a bitcoin on the quiet"

msgid "Raid gnome_trader"
msgstr "Gnome dealer"

msgid "Raid gnome_trader text"
msgstr "A gnome in a suit sells “one hundred percent working” loot. The price is just one of your items."

msgid "Raid gnome_trader luck"
msgstr "Buy without looking"

msgid "Raid gnome_ambush"
msgstr "Gnome ambush"

msgid "Raid gnome_ambush text"
msgstr "Five gnomes in Altyn helmets jump out of the bushes. The smallest one drags an RPK."

msgid "Raid gnome_ambush strength"
msgstr "Fight them off"

msgid "Raid gnome_ambush agility"
msgstr "Run, holding on to the backpack"

msgid "Raid gnome_pmc"
msgstr "Gnome PMC"

msgid "Raid gnome_pmc text"
msgstr "A gnome in full PMC gear: class 6 armor, a LEDX on his belt, knee-high."

msgid "Raid gnome_pmc strength"
msgstr "Shake the loot out of him"

msgid "Raid gnome_pmc luck"
msgstr "Ask for an autograph"

msgid "Raid retreat locked"
msgstr "No more running — time to take a risk"

msgid "Raid retreat legend %{limit}"
msgstr "🏃 a retreat: no more than %{limit} in a row"

msgid "Raid leave"
msgstr "Leave the raid"

msgid "Raid leave confirm"
msgstr "Leave the raid? The squad and its loot won't come back."
